        <body>
            <div xml:id="d82-a2">

                <pb facs="0160" n="814" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg814"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    239.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Proclamation</hi> No. 91.</head>
                <p>The officers and duties of the daishinin, and of the various courts, are
                    specified in the paper subjoined, and proclamation made accordingly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>SANJO SANEYOSHI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>DAIJO DAIJIN.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="japanese-nengō"
                            when="1875-05-24"><hi rendition="#italic">24th of the 5th month of the
                                8th year of Meiji</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>


                <xi:include href="d82-a2-a1.xml" xpointer="d82-a2-a1"/>
            </div>
